  "goodToKnow": "Die Ansprache is a short, formal speech or address: eine Ansprache halten. Every 31 December, the chancellor gives a Neujahrsansprache on TV, and at Christmas the Bundespräsident gives his Weihnachtsansprache. Keine Ansprache haben means to have nobody to talk to, a phrase used about loneliness. Ansprechen means to speak to or address someone, or to appeal: Das spricht mich an. Die Rede is the more general word for a speech."
